msgid "Write, upload, and run your first managed workflow, then get its results."
msgstr "اكتب أول سير عمل مُدار لك وارفعه وشغّله، ثم احصل على نتائجه."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy your first managed workflow"
msgstr "انشر أول سير عمل مُدار لك"

